# ---- Unreal build output -----------------------------------------------------
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
Build/

# ---- Steamworks SDK ----------------------------------------------------------
# Valve's SDK is not redistributable, so it is fetched per checkout rather than
# committed. Only the build rules and the licence descriptor live in the tree.
# See the "Steamworks SDK" section of README.md.
Source/ThirdParty/SteamworksSDK/Steamv*/
!Source/ThirdParty/SteamworksSDK/SteamworksSDK.build.cs

# App ID files belong to a developer's machine, not to the repository.
steam_appid.txt

